    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "there isn't really a thread. it's more like the thread's been cut and i'm just hanging there. it's not about pulling on it, it's just that i'm tired of the waiting. i wish i could just decide when the chapter ends instead of letting it drag on like this. i wish i had some kind of agency over it.",
